# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_28.rtc

The board's PCF85063 real-time clock at address 0x51.

It shares I2C1 with the board's other two devices: SDA on GP6 and SCL on GP7.
Each provider configures that bus before its first transfer, which is idempotent
and means no provider depends on another having been initialised first.
